                </div>
                <div class="my-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-3xl">
                    <span>🦀</span><span>🦐</span><span>🦌</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="font-black text-sm sm:text-base text-white">BẦU CUA & XÓC ĐĨA</div>
                    <div class="text-[11px] text-sky-300 font-semibold mt-0.5">Lắc Bát Đĩa Trực Tiếp</div>
